<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1445_5173.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unßer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear> willig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dinst</unclear>, unnd was wir
<lb n="2"/>ehren liebs unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guets</unclear> vermögend, mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wünsch</unclear>-
<lb n="3"/>ung von Gott eines <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gueten</unclear> glückhafften jars, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zu</unclear>-
<lb n="4"/>vor, from, fürsichtig, ersam wyß, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">innsonnd</unclear>-
<lb n="5"/>ers <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guet</unclear> fründt, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüw</unclear> lieb <orgName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßen</unclear></orgName>.
<lb n="6"/>Nachdem wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angesechnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gstaltßame</unclear> der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">yetzig</unclear>-
<lb n="7"/>en zyt unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">löüffenn</unclear>, unnd wie sich an den grentz-
<lb n="8"/>en <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einer</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßschafft</unclear></orgName>, sonderlichen inn der
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gegne</unclear> umb <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-169" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jenf</unclear></placeName>, vil <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">frömbd</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kriegsvolck</unclear> ent-
<lb n="10"/>haltet, auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anderstwo</unclear> umb ein <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßschafft</unclear></orgName>
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allenthalbenn</unclear> menigklich sich mit wehr unnd
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waaffen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gefaßt</unclear> zemachen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermanet</unclear> wirt
<lb n="13"/>unnd wie die sachen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">leider</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">inen</unclear> inn einer
<lb n="14"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßschafft</unclear></orgName> gestaltet, was an einem unnd
<lb n="15"/>dem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anderen</unclear> ort sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eröügt</unclear>, unnd was <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gmeiner</unclear>
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sachenn</unclear> noch vorhanden, darinnen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hievoor</unclear> uff
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gmeinen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tagleistungenn</unclear> gehandlet <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wordenn</unclear>,
<lb n="18"/>so hat unns, inn betrachtung <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dißer</unclear> dingen,
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einstheils</unclear> uß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getrüwer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürßorg</unclear>, so wir
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> erhaltung deß gmeinen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnößischen</unclear> fryg-
<lb n="21"/>en <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">standts</unclear>, und frid, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ruow</unclear> unnd einigkeit, inn
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnßerem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allgmeinen</unclear>, geliebten vatterlandt,
<lb n="23"/>tragend, unnd dann auch uß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guetachten</unclear>, etlicher
<lb n="24"/>orten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnßerer</unclear> lieben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßen</unclear>, ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gmeine</unclear>
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnößische</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeßamenkhunfft</unclear> (daruf dann auch
<lb n="26"/>by <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jüngst</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ghaltnem</unclear> tag zu <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-53" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Baden</placeName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andütung</unclear> be-
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schächen</unclear>) für gantz notwendig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angeßächen</unclear>, da-
<lb n="28"/>mit man sich mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einanderen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dißer</unclear> dingen
<lb n="29"/>halber, daran unns allen gmeinlich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gelägen</unclear>,
<lb n="30"/>der gebür nach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnößisch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear> under-
<lb n="31"/>rede, unnd uff <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allen</unclear> fal gegen ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anderen</unclear>,
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erclere</unclear>. Darumb so habent wir uß
<lb n="33"/>erzelter <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gueter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnößischer</unclear> wolmeinung,
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1445_5174.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="34"/>ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gmeine</unclear> tagleistung aller orten unnd zuo=
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gwandten</unclear> der <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Eidtgnoschafft</orgName> angesetzt und ußge=
<lb n="36"/>schriben, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">namblich</unclear> uff <date resp="#ner">Sontag den 29 <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">t</unclear>.
<lb n="37"/>tag deß nechstkommenden monats <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jenners</unclear></date>, ab=
<lb n="38"/>ents <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-53" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Baden</placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inn</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-266" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ergoew</unclear></placeName> an der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herberg</unclear> zuo=
<lb n="39"/>erschynen. Unnd gelangt daruf an
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uwer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnßere</unclear> fründtlichs <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begaehren</unclear> und bitt=
<lb n="41"/>en, ir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">woellind</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uwer</unclear> bottschafft umb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soell=</unclear>
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ich</unclear> sachen den gmein, unnd dann auch von
<lb n="43"/>der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Frantzoesischen</unclear> so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schlaechten</unclear> zalung <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">waegen</unclear>,
<lb n="44"/>wie demselben wyter <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zethuond</unclear>, mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">notwend=</unclear>
<lb n="45"/>igem bevelch und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gwalt</unclear> uff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ernente</unclear> zyt gen
<lb n="46"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-53" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Baden</placeName> abfertigen, umb alle <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dißere</unclear> sach=
<lb n="47"/>en sich mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einanderen</unclear> der nothurfft nach zuoer=
<lb n="48"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">spraechen</unclear>, unnd dahin zetrachten, wie unnder
<lb n="49"/>unns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gmeinlich</unclear> inn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einer</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Eidtgnoschafft</orgName>, frid,
<lb n="50"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ruow</unclear>, unnd einigkeit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gepflantzet</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geoeffnet</unclear>
<lb n="51"/>alles <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schaedlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mißthruwen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hingenommen</unclear>, unnd
<lb n="52"/>der wolstandt unnd fryheit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inn</unclear> die wir von
<lb n="53"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnßeren</unclear> frommen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorderen</unclear>, durch die gnad
<lb n="54"/>Gottes gesetzt sind, fürer erhalten, unnd also
<lb n="55"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hiemit</unclear> unnßer <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aller</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">syts</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mißgünstigen</unclear>, all=
<lb n="56"/>er anlaß unns gmeinlich oder <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sonderlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anzuo=</unclear>
<lb n="57"/>fechten, benommen werde, wie wir üch
<lb n="58"/>dann darzuo geneigt syn wüßend, und unß=
<lb n="59"/>ers theils das auch nach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnßerem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermoegen</unclear>
<lb n="60"/>inn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thruwen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zethuond</unclear> geneigt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sind</unclear>.
<lb n="61"/>Mit der hilff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnßeres</unclear> herren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gottes</unclear>, dem
<lb n="62"/>wir üch inn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">synen</unclear> schirm bevelchend, unnd
<lb n="63"/>unns gegen üch aller <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eidtgnoeßischen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thruw</unclear>,
<lb n="64"/>liebe, unnd fründtschafft anerbietend. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Date</unclear>
<lb n="65"/>den <origDate when="1603-12-29" resp="#ner">29 <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">t</unclear> Decembris, anno 1603</origDate>.
<lb n="66"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-503" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und rath
